{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32956","headline":"有赠 二 · 崔珏","name":"有赠 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦里芬芳少佩兰，风流全占似君难。\n心迷晓梦窗犹暗，粉落香肌汗未乾。\n两脸夭桃从镜发，一眸春水照人寒。\n自嗟此地非吾土，不得如花岁岁看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔珏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32956.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32956","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}